# -i219 presents 8086:15b8 and models the one requirement with a named
# failure mode: K1 left enabled at 1 Gbps stalls the MAC. The power-up value
# of page 770 register 17 is the platform's NVM setting, which we do not have
# for this board; the model's default is -i219-k1-nvm 1, K1 on, which is the
# condition the campaign is about, so this arm takes the default rather than
# naming it. e1000-pch-k1-off is the same arm with it named off.
-i219
